    "[![Slack](https://img.shields.io/badge/slack-996icu-green.svg?style=flat-square)](https://join.slack.com/t/996icu/shared_invite/enQtNjI0MjEzMTUxNDI0LTkyMGViNmJiZjYwOWVlNzQ3NmQ4NTQyMDRiZTNmOWFkMzYxZWNmZGI0NDA4MWIwOGVhOThhMzc3NGQyMDBhZDc)\n",
